# Best Practices

When designing a Log Analytics Workspace:

- Organize workspaces according to organizational requirements.
- Apply consistent naming conventions.
- Monitor ingestion health.
- Optimize retention policies.
- Protect workspace access using RBAC.
- Validate data ingestion regularly.
- Remove unused data sources.

